  "releaseNotes": "First stable release.\n\nFluentResults.HttpMapping provides a declarative, rule-based way to map\nFluentResults Result and Result<T> to HTTP responses in ASP.NET Core.\n\nKey features:\n- Rule-based HTTP mapping\n- RFC 7807 Problem Details support\n- Header mapping support\n- Works with Minimal APIs and MVC controllers\n- Fully DI-configured",
